    "message": "Keep revoked Cookie requests denied at their earliest authority fence\n\nClean-main CI reproduced a stale error expectation: a missing website capability is rejected before the old intent epoch is compared. Preserve the stronger early denial and align this one assertion; retain the parallel fixture additions unstaged.\n\nConstraint: No native Cookie write after capability revocation; preserve parallel working bytes\nRejected: Reordering or weakening Host checks | would delay the real denial to satisfy an outdated fixture\nConfidence: high\nScope-risk: narrow\nTested: Clean-commit SDK suite reproduced the exact failure; working-tree SDK CI Node 201/201; strict ledger and source checks\nNot-tested: Same-commit full native acceptance remains incomplete",
